{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51426","headline":"晋元帝庙 · 李商隐","name":"晋元帝庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山遗庙与僧邻，断镞残碑锁暗尘。\n紫盖适符江左运，翠华空忆洛中春。\n夜台无月照珠户，秋殿有风开玉宸。\n弓剑神灵定何处？年年春绿上麒麟。\n（《浩然斋雅谈》（见《四库全书》本《浩然斋雅谈》卷中，四库馆臣注：「案此诗李商隐集不载，未详所据何本，疑姓名有误。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}